        <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3)">Boundary &middot; hosted tier</span>
        <span style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.45">Semantic search, AI interpretation and multi-team support live in a separately-bounded tier. Enable it or don&rsquo;t; the core doesn&rsquo;t change.</span>
