        <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text-1);text-wrap:pretty">CLS-inspired local consolidation fine-tunes a small model on your repo&rsquo;s own curated notes, entirely locally. A new version is gated against a held-out eval. If retrieval quality regresses, it doesn&rsquo;t replace the current one.</p>
